      69→## Features
      70→
      71→  * Robust routing
      72→  * Focus on high performance
      73→  * Super-high test coverage
      74→  * HTTP helpers (redirection, caching, etc)
      75→  * View system supporting 14+ template engines
      76→  * Content negotiation
      77→  * Executable for generating applications quickly
